    "shortDescTop": "<p>The Asnis III 6.5/8.0mm System offers you a wide choice of implants, material and packaging for hip fracture treatment. You can use the same instrument set for 6.5mm and 8.0mm screw ranges. <br />\r\n</p>\r\n",
